choice("Continue", Ch8-Banshee, v_current_scene = Ch8-Banshee)


ID: Ch8-Prisoner
TEXT:

 "Maybe she's a prisoner here too, and the organizers don't know about her."

"Possible," Daren muses. "Though why she'd hide that from fellow escapees is anyone's guess."

"It doesn't matter who she is," Kate cuts in. "She knows these ruins, and if she served the beasts, she would have sounded an alarm already. There's only one path forward. We follow her and judge her intentions as we go."

We catch up to Flower just as her voice shifts. The tone drops—sharp, frigid, and commanding. She keeps walking, her back to us.

